{"title": "Gathering Drumbeat (Condition)", "pageid": 35312, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gathering_Drumbeat_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Utility Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Gathering Drumbeat</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>A goblin has sounded these war drums, calling reinforcements to battle.</li>\n<li>Will draw nearby goblins into combat. If used in the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a>, will turn the entire camp hostile as well. All <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Temporarily_Hostile_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporarily Hostile (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Temporarily Hostile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Temporarily_Hostile_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Temporarily_Hostile_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporarily Hostile (Condition)\">Temporarily Hostile</a> enemies become permanently hostile. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">WARDRUM_ALERTED</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WARDRUM_ALERTED+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WARDRUM_ALERTED+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715011401\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 949/1000000\nPost‐expand inc